{"id": "EUVD-2026-59728", "enisaUuid": "9a38bc73-abdb-3b2a-abd7-fd0e6af8448c", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nBluetooth: ISO: avoid deadlocks in iso_sock_timeout\n\niso_sock_timeout() takes lock_sock, so sync disabling the timer while\nholding that lock may deadlock.\n\niso_sock_timeout() may also run concurrently with iso_conn_del(), which\nleads to UAF\n\n        [Task 1]                      [Task hdev->workqueue]\n        iso_sock_timeout              iso_conn_del\n          iso_conn_hold_unless_zero     iso_chan_del\n                           `------------> iso_conn_put\n                                      caller frees hcon\n          iso_conn_put\n            iso_conn_free\n              conn->hcon->iso_data = NULL; /* UAF */\n\nFix the deadlock by removing the disable from the lock_sock sections.\nMove the timer from iso_conn to iso_pinfo to decouple it from iso_conn\nwhich may need to be freed in lock_sock section. Convert some of the\nclear_timer to disable_timer.", "datePublished": "2026-08-15T12:27:48", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T19:05:53", "baseScore": 8.8, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:A/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/16d89a63e08280abeef7218970a3bbd7ca62b021", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/82e982f54f962f72646868ddbb2c3bd9ea178568", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3c3d5f85db80145636bb991a6005e2760012b985", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/200fa1629c57a3ca2b03d3ca63fd3a9bfd910c43"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m6r7-j582-3j5f", "CVE-2026-74535"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "101076d3-9fb4-3343-857b-aa3fd2aa3f2a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "f53e7489273dc2bb307bf50f319b3762d45534f0"}, {"id": "23657c8f-3447-305d-9c21-09e01c59ed0a", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "31848d38-c6fc-3863-a970-5f24871fbeba", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.8"}, {"id": "32525433-86cd-3ad3-82a1-c58f15770cc1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.44"}, {"id": "415b4759-e912-381d-9c5c-49a0fdbbacf9", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dc26097bdb864a0d5955b9a25e43376ffc1af99b <82e982f54f962f72646868ddbb2c3bd9ea178568"}, {"id": "6c393489-4a58-3511-8596-a141439841b3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.11.11 <6.12"}, {"id": "8042ee92-423c-3892-97e9-4ad17bcee230", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.12.2 <6.12.103"}, {"id": "80fb24e0-7ed5-3c42-bdf6-0e3d9c738754", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dc26097bdb864a0d5955b9a25e43376ffc1af99b <200fa1629c57a3ca2b03d3ca63fd3a9bfd910c43"}, {"id": "83cd5442-dc0b-34ae-8cff-74847da31803", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.103"}, {"id": "8fd5d593-7f28-3a59-87db-3b349f670de7", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.13"}, {"id": "b2a1be19-a9a5-3cd5-9118-291351aefbcb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "dc26097bdb864a0d5955b9a25e43376ffc1af99b <3c3d5f85db80145636bb991a6005e2760012b985"}, {"id": "bcd5fbfc-a8ba-3e39-8236-7e8b181f3de8", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "c7f2bace-1676-351a-8baa-33ac086e1dad", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "a58d0f5dac322e16cc75334d000666512341bde5 <16d89a63e08280abeef7218970a3bbd7ca62b021"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "f3ae153b-7216-3c20-9dc7-1c8e813261dd", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}